&lt;h2 id=&#34;oneclickevict&#34;&gt;OneClickEvict&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contain, remediate, and restore compromised Microsoft Entra ID accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Uses Microsoft Graph to automate the response actions for a compromised Entra ID identity. It disables accounts and revokes tokens at scale, uses Conditional Access policies to cover hybrid environments, and tracks remediation through security groups. It also removes malicious inbox rules, registered applications and app consents, and securely resets passwords in bulk.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
